omr-homr-ios
============

This package ports Optical Music Recognition algorithms and tokenizers
compatible with liebharc/homr.

Credits (required):
- liebharc/homr — https://github.com/liebharc/homr (AGPL-3.0)
- BreezeWhite/oemer
- NetEase/Polyphonic-TrOMR

ONNX checkpoints: https://github.com/liebharc/homr/releases/tag/onnx_checkpoints

Do not ship this package inside a proprietary App Store binary without a
valid AGPL-compliant distribution plan (or a dual-license you control).
